Interviewers frequently ask this.

Pod

Runs containers.

Pod
 ↓
Container
ReplicaSet

Maintains desired number of Pods.

ReplicaSet
 ↓
Pods
Deployment

Manages ReplicaSets and rollout/rollback.

Deployment
 ↓
ReplicaSets
 ↓
Pods
